accTitle: A deployment attachment enables runtime credentials
accDescr: CloudFormation creates a role and profile and attaches the profile to EC2, while the application obtains temporary credentials at runtime.
CF["CloudFormation deployment"] --> ROLE["IAM role: EC2 trust and table permissions"]
ROLE -->|Contained in| PROF["Instance profile"]
PROF -->|IamInstanceProfile property| EC2["EC2 application instance"]
EC2 -->|SDK credential provider| META["Instance metadata"]
META -->|Rotating temporary credentials| APP["Application SDK"]
APP -->|Signed allowed requests| DB[("DynamoDB table")]
